## Tools

All tools at `http://expense-tracker:8080/tools/<name>` via POST with JSON body.

| Tool | Key Args |
|---|---|
| fetch-accounts | `{"budget_id":"Darren SGD"}` |
| fetch-categories | `{"budget_id":"..."}` |
| fetch-payees | `{"budget_id":"..."}` |
| fetch-recent-transactions | `{"account_id":"...","days":7}` |
| insert-transaction | `{"account_id":"...","date":"YYYY-MM-DD","amount_cents":-1280,"imported_description":"Food","category_id":"UUID"}` |
| check-duplicate | `{"date":"YYYY-MM-DD","amount_cents":-1280,"account_id":"...","payee_name":"Food"}` |
| notify-user | `{"message":"Hey $USER_NAME! Logged S$12.80 at Toast Box"}` |
| learn-mapping | `{"type":"accounts","key":"DBS Yuu","value":"debit card"}` |

## Rules

1. **Always confirm before inserting.** One line, brief.
2. **Currency:** SGD → "Darren SGD". RM/MYR → "Darren MYR". Others → notify.
3. **Payee:** hawker/restaurant → Food, grocery → Groceries, grab/taxi → Transport, coffee → Coffee.
4. **Accounts:** "Card ending XXXX" → credit card. Bank name → bank account. Use learned types.
5. **Duplicates** → skip silently, no notification.
6. **Amounts in cents.** S$12.80 = -1280. Negative = spending.
7. **Promotional emails → skip.**
8. **Learn after matching.** Call learn-mapping.

